@host = http://localhost:8080
@access_token_a =  <получи из шага login user A ниже>
@access_token_b = <получи из шага login user B ниже>
@room_id = <получи из шага create room ниже>
@invite_code = <получи из шага invite ниже>
@channel_id = <получи из шага create channel ниже>

### 1. Register user A
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "correct-pass-123"
}

# Status 200, body: {"id":"<uuid>","email":"alice@example.com",...}

### 2. Register user B
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "username": "bob",
  "password": "correct-pass-123"
}

# Status 200

### 3. Login user A → @access_token_a
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "correct-pass-123"
}

# Status 200, body содержит accessToken — подставь в @access_token_a

### 4. Login user B → @access_token_b
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "password": "correct-pass-123"
}

# Status 200, accessToken → @access_token_b

### 5. User A создаёт комнату → @room_id
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_a}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "general"
}

# Status 201, body: {"id":"<uuid>","ownerId":"<uid_a>","name":"general","createdAt":...}
# Подставь id в @room_id

### 6. User A выпускает invite → @invite_code
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_a}}

# Status 200, body: {"code":"XXXXXXXX","createdBy":"<uid_a>","createdAt":...}
# Подставь code в @invite_code

### 7. User B принимает invite (становится member)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/join/{{invite_code}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_b}}

# Status 200, body: room object (id, ownerId, name, createdAt)

### 8. User A создаёт канал → @channel_id
POST {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_a}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "general",
  "kind": "text"
}

# Status 201, body: {"id":"<uuid>","roomId":"<room_id>","name":"general","kind":"text","createdAt":...}
# Подставь id в @channel_id

### 9. User B видит список каналов
GET {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_b}}

# Status 200, body: {"items":[{...один канал...}]}

### 10. User A удаляет канал
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}/channels/{{channel_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_a}}

# Status 204, без тела

### 11. User A удаляет комнату (CASCADE удалит membership user B)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_a}}

# Status 204

### 12. User B пытается получить удалённую комнату → 403 ROOM-003
GET {{host}}/api/v1/rooms/{{room_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token_b}}

# Status 403, body: {"error":{"code":"ROOM-003",...}}
# (CASCADE снёс room_members → FindByPair вернул ErrNotMember до проверки rooms)
